The 5-Minute Homemade Icecream — Creamy, delicious, low calorie, and can be made high protein. This is incredible, and this is coming from a Ninja Creami owner.

Full Recipe (1 serving)
* Frozen mango — 280g (approx. 2 cups)
* Greek yogurt — 60g (approx. 1/4 cup)
* Sweetener (e.g., stevia) — 1 tbsp (optional)
* Vanilla protein powder — 30g, 1 scoop (optional)

Method: Blend all ingredients together until smooth and creamy. Serve immediately and enjoy.

Macros (per portion, with protein powder included)
* Calories: ~340 kcal
* Protein: ~28g
* Carbs: ~52g
* Fat: ~2g
* Fibre: ~4g

Verdict
9/10 — This is incredible, and this is coming from a Ninja Creami owner. We’ve done other healthy ice creams before, but they always take hours in the freezer. This literally came together all within five minutes. It’s fantastically tasty, completely satisfies your ice cream cravings without the wait, and I a thousand percent recommend.

